/E (But just as parameter changes have added to the revenue flowing into government coffers, policy decisions have seen that money flow out again. In particular, the decision to provide new personal income tax cuts for all Australian taxpayers from 1 July 2026 means that the net effect of policy and parameter changes since the 2024-25 MYEFO will see revenue just $1.9 billion higher over the four years to 2027-28.)
